remember to never say never, always avoid always, etc.

no one can stop you from trying to tame the demon but don't be too
disappointed if the demon somehow resists your taming spells.

the game makes a distinction between peaceful and tame (and notes
these when using the "/" command on screen monsters).  peaceful
monsters don't normally bother you (but not always!) and tame
monsters are yours and require food, for example.

btw, there's a chance the taming spell itself might randomly fail.

